  "paragraphs": [
    "• A separate hostel facility is available for boys and girls and provided a separate cots to each and every student with well-lit, ventilated rooms for boys and girls on the campus of Abdul Kalam institute of technological & science.",
    "• The health of the students staying in the hostel is supported by a mineral water plant and a medical centre.",
    "•Food ,Snacks and drinks available at AKITS Cafeteria in all over the day",
    "• Hostels offer security at all times.",
    "• After College hours, hostel students have access to the internet, library resources, sports & games",
    "•Tutorial Classes are conducted for hostel students."
  ],
